  3.326535345252830  -0.000004296765414  0.000000000000000
  -1.663271394032725  2.880861966652899  0.000000000000000
  0.000000000000000  0.000000000000000  19.053366518000001

ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
W  0.000000000000000  0.000000000000000  0.000000000000000  0 0 0
Se  0.333330005000000  0.666670024000000  0.088214384328335  0 0 1
